From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Jordan <scott@spaceshipcreative.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 04:49:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01/25] [Bugfix] Seed hybrid mamba state index with
 mamba_block_size on prefix-cache hits (#55601)

Cherry-picked from vllm-project/vllm#55601 (3d6853b32c7c872df00d9e3489f642dc22e974e0)
by pondzikk <pondzik@gmail.com> (with zjy0516 and ptorsten), Apache-2.0.
Applied cleanly on v0.31.0. With a DFlash drafter group, cache_config.block_size
is the drafter's smaller block (1152) while the KDA/Mamba state column must be
indexed in mamba blocks (2304); on a prefix-cache hit align mode seeded the
running state index from the wrong block size.

Original trailers:
Signed-off-by: pondzikk <pondzik@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: zjy0516 <riverclouds.zhu@qq.com>
Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Co-authored-by: zjy0516 <riverclouds.zhu@qq.com>
Co-authored-by: ptorsten <1652174+ptorsten@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit 3d6853b32c7c872df00d9e3489f642dc22e974e0)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_states/mamba_hybrid.py | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_states/mamba_hybrid.py b/vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_states/mamba_hybrid.py
index 32924555b..aff32d5ea 100644
--- a/vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_states/mamba_hybrid.py
+++ b/vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_states/mamba_hybrid.py
@@ -114,8 +114,13 @@ class MambaHybridModelState(DefaultModelState):
         self.num_accepted_tokens_gpu[req_index].fill_(1)
         if self._align_mode:
             # Seed the running state block from the resumed/prefilled position.
+            # The column is in mamba blocks. cache_config.block_size is the
+            # min over prefix-cacheable groups, so a drafter group with its own
+            # smaller block (e.g. DFlash) pulls it below mamba_block_size.
+            mamba_block_size = self.cache_config.mamba_block_size
+            assert mamba_block_size is not None
             self._mamba_state_idx_gpu[req_index].fill_(
-                (new_req_data.num_computed_tokens - 1) // self.cache_config.block_size
+                (new_req_data.num_computed_tokens - 1) // mamba_block_size
             )
 
     def _get_mamba_group_info(
